Prepared for itorrents-igruha.org: Are you ready to head to a major international airport to perform major aircraft maintenance? Then meet Airport Simulator 2015There's no time to rest or get bored—26 exciting missions await, requiring a sharp focus and quick reflexes. The airline won't suffer any losses, so there shouldn't be any delays. Only a responsible approach is possible here, so get ready!

Five types of aircraft "serve" at the airport: passenger Boeing 737-200, Boeing 747-400, Cessna 550, Airbus 380, and cargo Airbus 380F. Players assume the roles of all technical services. They have 14 vehicles at their disposal, which they must take control of one at a time. Since this is a simulator, the camera view is from the cockpit, enhancing realism and creating a sense of immersion.

What to do in the game?
So, if you decide to download a torrent Airport Simulator 2015, you'll be transporting passengers to and from the aircraft. A shuttle bus, a self-propelled boarding bridge, and a jet bridge are available for this purpose. You'll also need to deliver food, passenger baggage, and cargo on board, if it's a cargo aircraft. A catering vehicle, a cargo transporter, and a forklift will help you accomplish these tasks.

It's also important to ensure the aircraft reach the hangar safely. A tractor and escort vehicle will help the player with this. Regular aircraft maintenance is also essential. A fuel tanker, a ground power unit, and a de-icing vehicle are available for this purpose.

Airport Simulator 2015 The game features realistic graphics and physics. The time of day and weather conditions change dynamically. While conditions won't always be ideal, it might rain or snow. Snow can be an obstacle to aircraft takeoffs and landings, so it's important to clear the area promptly.

To ensure gamers can handle this task with flying colors, the developers have offered three types of snowplows. A well-designed achievement system ensures that all vehicles can be upgraded. Furthermore, the simulator's sound is also top-notch — even radio communications are audible.

What is unique about it? Airport Simulator 2015 ?
- a large airport area placed under the control of the gamer;
- 5 aircraft models that require comprehensive maintenance;
- 14 different vehicles that help with aircraft maintenance and cleaning of the territory;
- tasks are generated dynamically, which makes the gameplay varied;
- an achievement system that allows you to improve vehicles;
- realistic physics of aircraft and service vehicles;
- realistic graphics with changing weather conditions and time of day;
- realistic sound effects, including noise and radio communications.

Installation:
1. Mount the image, install the game
2. Copy the contents of the "PLAZA" folder to the folder with the installed game and replace them.
3. Play
